# Accepted findings, each with a reason. Reviewed on every change to this file.

# AVD-AWS-0107: security group allows ingress from 0.0.0.0/0.
# Port 80 of a public demo web server is meant to be public. Set
# allowed_http_cidrs to your own IP to make the demo private.
AVD-AWS-0107

# AVD-AWS-0104: security group allows egress to 0.0.0.0/0.
# The instance pulls OS packages and a container image from public registries.
# A production setup would use VPC endpoints + a pull-through cache instead.
AVD-AWS-0104
